{"schema_version": "1.0.0", "knowledge_id": "K-GBT33170.2-2016-000052", "doc_id": "GBT33170.2-2016", "statement": "大型活动承办者应根据不同的预警级别，准确、及时、有效发布对应的预警信息。预警信息应能正确引导大型活动工作人员处置预警，并应能快速疏导人员。", "knowledge_type": "requirement", "normative_force": "recommended", "source_modality": "应", "conditions": [], "actors": ["活动承办方"], "objects": [], "actions": [], "applicable_stages": [], "topics": ["活动承办方"], "scenarios": [], "source_refs": [{"node_id": "GBT33170.2-2016@7.2.4", "pdf_page": 8, "printed_page": "5", "source_file": "source/original.pdf"}], "derivation": "extractive", "confidence": 0.95, "verification_status": "page_aligned"}
{"schema_version": "1.0.0", "knowledge_id": "K-GBT33170.2-2016-000053", "doc_id": "GBT33170.2-2016", "statement": "预警解除，大型活动承办者应及时发布撤销预警的相关信息。", "knowledge_type": "requirement", "normative_force": "recommended", "source_modality": "应", "conditions": [], "actors": ["活动承办方"], "objects": [], "actions": [], "applicable_stages": [], "topics": ["活动承办方"], "scenarios": [], "source_refs": [{"node_id": "GBT33170.2-2016@7.2.5", "pdf_page": 8, "printed_page": "5", "source_file": "source/original.pdf"}], "derivation": "extractive", "confidence": 0.95, "verification_status": "page_aligned"}
{"schema_version": "1.0.0", "knowledge_id": "K-GBT33170.2-2016-000054", "doc_id": "GBT33170.2-2016", "statement": "人员携带物品监测一般在人员进入大型活动举办区域前进行，拒绝接受检查者不准参与大型活动。", "knowledge_type": "fact", "normative_force": "informational", "source_modality": null, "conditions": [], "actors": [], "objects": [], "actions": [], "applicable_stages": [], "topics": [], "scenarios": [], "source_refs": [{"node_id": "GBT33170.2-2016@8.1", "pdf_page": 8, "printed_page": "5", "source_file": "source/original.pdf"}], "derivation": "extractive", "confidence": 0.95, "verification_status": "page_aligned"}
{"schema_version": "1.0.0", "knowledge_id": "K-GBT33170.2-2016-000055", "doc_id": "GBT33170.2-2016", "statement": "在监测过程中，发现人员或车辆携带禁带物品时，安检人员应对该禁带物品进行复检，如确属禁带物品，则由公安机关按规定控制住禁带物品携带人，并扣留禁带物品，对该物品作进一步确认和处理。", "knowledge_type": "fact", "normative_force": "informational", "source_modality": null, "conditions": [], "actors": ["公安机关"], "objects": [], "actions": [], "applicable_stages": [], "topics": ["公安机关", "安全检查"], "scenarios": [], "source_refs": [{"node_id": "GBT33170.2-2016@8.2.1", "pdf_page": 9, "printed_page": "6", "source_file": "source/original.pdf"}], "derivation": "extractive", "confidence": 0.95, "verification_status": "page_aligned"}
{"schema_version": "1.0.0", "knowledge_id": "K-GBT33170.2-2016-000056", "doc_id": "GBT33170.2-2016", "statement": "在监测过程中，发现人员或车辆携带限带物品，提示安检人员对该限带物品进行复检，如确属限带物品，不得带入大型活动区域，由大型活动承办者代为保管或者由携带者自行处置。", "knowledge_type": "prohibition", "normative_force": "prohibited", "source_modality": "不得", "conditions": [], "actors": ["活动承办方"], "objects": [], "actions": [], "applicable_stages": [], "topics": ["安全检查", "活动承办方"], "scenarios": [], "source_refs": [{"node_id": "GBT33170.2-2016@8.2.2", "pdf_page": 9, "printed_page": "6", "source_file": "source/original.pdf"}], "derivation": "extractive", "confidence": 0.95, "verification_status": "page_aligned"}
{"schema_version": "1.0.0", "knowledge_id": "K-GBT33170.2-2016-000057", "doc_id": "GBT33170.2-2016", "statement": "在监测过程中，发现人员或车辆有非法入侵、单向越界、双向越界、进入禁区、离开禁区或有影响活动进程的长期徘徊、快速运动、逆行行为时，活动承办者应及时派工作人员予以劝阻。不听劝阻的，在可能影响到大型活动安全的情况下，可先采取必要的控制措施，并报公安部门处理。", "knowledge_type": "requirement", "normative_force": "recommended", "source_modality": "应", "conditions": [], "actors": ["公安机关", "活动承办方"], "objects": [], "actions": [], "applicable_stages": [], "topics": ["公安机关", "活动承办方"], "scenarios": [], "source_refs": [{"node_id": "GBT33170.2-2016@8.3", "pdf_page": 9, "printed_page": "6", "source_file": "source/original.pdf"}], "derivation": "extractive", "confidence": 0.95, "verification_status": "page_aligned"}
{"schema_version": "1.0.0", "knowledge_id": "K-GBT33170.2-2016-000058", "doc_id": "GBT33170.2-2016", "statement": "在监测过程中，发现人群聚集和拥挤现象时，活动承办者应及时派工作人员予以疏导。发生人群聚集报警后的现场秩序维护、人群疏导的主要工作包括：\n\n- 对水、电、气等重点部位的看护；\n- 对桥梁、涵洞、窄路、水域等危险区域的控制；\n- 对出人口、安全通道的疏导；\n- 入退场人员和车辆的导向；\n- 人场人员达到安全额定容量时的控制；\n- 广播疏导宣传。", "knowledge_type": "requirement", "normative_force": "recommended", "source_modality": "应", "conditions": [], "actors": ["活动承办方"], "objects": [], "actions": [], "applicable_stages": ["散场", "活动期间"], "topics": ["人群拥挤", "人群管控", "信息发布", "活动承办方"], "scenarios": ["人群拥挤"], "source_refs": [{"node_id": "GBT33170.2-2016@8.4", "pdf_page": 9, "printed_page": "6", "source_file": "source/original.pdf"}], "derivation": "extractive", "confidence": 0.95, "verification_status": "page_aligned"}
{"schema_version": "1.0.0", "knowledge_id": "K-GBT33170.2-2016-000059", "doc_id": "GBT33170.2-2016", "statement": "大型活动承办者应制定相关处置方案，针对人员扰乱滋事、群体性突发事件以及其他恶劣天气、火灾、气体泄漏、人为破坏基础设施等突发事件明确处置程序。", "knowledge_type": "requirement", "normative_force": "recommended", "source_modality": "应", "conditions": [], "actors": ["活动承办方"], "objects": [], "actions": [], "applicable_stages": [], "topics": ["应急管理", "恶劣天气", "活动承办方", "火灾"], "scenarios": ["恶劣天气", "火灾"], "source_refs": [{"node_id": "GBT33170.2-2016@8.5", "pdf_page": 9, "printed_page": "6", "source_file": "source/original.pdf"}], "derivation": "extractive", "confidence": 0.95, "verification_status": "page_aligned"}
